        "Description": "WIRELESS FREEDOM: Sunseeker X7 uses advanced RTK-GNSS technology for easy boundary setup, precise navigation, and flawless mowing even in complex gardens UNRIVALED PERFORMANCE: Conquer any terrain confidently with the AWD Driving System and floating dual-blade design, guaranteeing exceptional traction and cutting efficiency EFFORTLESS MANAGEMENT: Customize your mowing experience with intelligent path planning, adjustable cutting height, and control multiple work areas and settings through the intuitive Sunseeker app RAIN-READY RELIABILITY: With auto-recharge, waterproof design, and rain detection, the Sunseeker X7 ensures safe, effortless mowing in any weather. APP-CONTROLLED: Manage schedules and settings easily from your smartphone with the intuitive app. QUIET EFFICIENCY: Capable of mowing up to 0.75 acres quietly and efficiently, making it perfect for larger lawns. DUAL CUTTING BLADES: Equipped with two 14 inch blades, the Sunseeker X7 delivers clean and precise cuts even through dense grass for a professional looking finish.",
